x=x.replace('NullSignal 2.0 keeps exact latitude/longitude, route points, speed, bearing and learned place visits so it can reconstruct journeys, find last-seen devices and learn mobility anomalies.','NullSignal 2.1 keeps exact GPS, route points, speed, bearing, public-transit segment transitions and learned places so it can reconstruct commutes, estimate personal ETA, detect route/delay anomalies and find last-seen devices.')
